From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shiji Yang <yangshiji66@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 12:40:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: connac: remove useless tx_power calculation

The variable tx_power was calculated but never used.

Fixes: 317bc1a0590e ("wifi: mt76: connac: factor out rate power limit calculation")
Signed-off-by: Shiji Yang <yangshiji66@outlook.com>
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/OSCPR01MB15019FDE88A442FBC74081EAABC782@OSCPR01MB15019.jpnprd01.prod.outlook.com
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
(cherry picked from commit 41d5d1dd63111870ef74a5b9645416d98979a145)
---
 mt76_connac_mcu.c | 5 +----
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/mt76_connac_mcu.c b/mt76_connac_mcu.c
index 4c79d32a..6790765c 100644
--- a/mt76_connac_mcu.c
+++ b/mt76_connac_mcu.c
@@ -2219,7 +2219,7 @@ mt76_connac_mcu_rate_txpower_band(struct mt76_phy *phy,
 		209, 211, 213, 215, 217, 219, 221,
 		225, 227, 229, 233
 	};
-	int i, n_chan, batch_size, idx = 0, tx_power, last_ch, err = 0;
+	int i, n_chan, batch_size, idx = 0, last_ch, err = 0;
 	struct mt76_connac_sku_tlv sku_tlbv;
 	struct mt76_power_limits *limits;
 	const u8 *ch_list;
@@ -2229,9 +2229,6 @@ mt76_connac_mcu_rate_txpower_band(struct mt76_phy *phy,
 		return -ENOMEM;
 
 	sku_len = is_connac2(dev) ? sizeof(sku_tlbv) : sizeof(sku_tlbv) - 92;
-	tx_power = 2 * phy->hw->conf.power_level;
-	if (!tx_power)
-		tx_power = 127;
 
 	if (band == NL80211_BAND_2GHZ) {
 		n_chan = ARRAY_SIZE(chan_list_2ghz);
